Subject: [PATCH 41/56] =?UTF-8?q?feat(ai):=20=EC=A6=9D=EA=B6=8C=EC=82=AC?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20=EC=95=A0=EB=84=90=EB=A6=AC=EC=8A=A4=ED=8A=B8=20=EB=A6=AC?=
